        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "seseorang yang dilantik di bawah subseksyen 15a(1) Akta Tatacara Kewangan 1957; atau"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/msa@/~part_I__cl_5__subsec_1__list_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
